<title>CHINA: Shenzhen Properties H1 net sags 66 pct.</title>
<headline>Shenzhen Properties H1 net sags 66 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half-year ended June 30, 1997 (in millions of yuan unless stated, against 1996 figures):</p>
<p>    Turnover     218.38    vs  318.71</p>
<p>    Net Profits   4.97     vs   14.73</p>
<p>    Earnings per share    0.009 yuan</p>
<p>    Net assets per share   2.54 yuan</p>
<p>Company name: Shenzhen Properties &amp; Resources Development (Group) Ltd.</p>
<p>Note: The unaudited results, under international accounting standards, were published in a report in the Shenzhen-based Securities Times on Saturday.</p>
<p>For the first half of 1996, the company had earnings per share of 0.027 yuan and net assets of 2.54 yuan based on Chinese accounting standards. Year-ago per share figures based on international standards were not available.</p>
